<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Mantle Jump macro</Major>
    <Description>This macro definitely works. Since the double jump issue has been resolved, it should work on any zip line.

Just get the timing right, and the macro will do the rest for you.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 22 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyDown 44 1
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyDown 44 1
KeyUp 44 1
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 26 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>